WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.375
The dial turns the cam and the wheels begin to turn one after another.

00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:12.000
The near wheel’s notch is beside the fence. Its rim is directly underneath.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.625
One wheel holds up the fence. The lever sits too high for the cam to pull the bolt back.
